: convert-noop-compute-shader
:
: Convert the same no-op SPIR-V compute shader used by libmoltenvk's own
: smoke test (../../../libmoltenvk/tests/basics/driver.cpp) to MSL,
: exercising convertSPIRV(). Requires real Metal-capable hardware. Fixture
: $spv is generated at build time from noop.spv.hex via xxd (see buildfile).
:
$* -q -si $spv -mo out.metal &out.metal 2>!;
sed -n -e 's/.*(kernel void).*/\1/p' out.metal >>EOO
kernel void
EOO
